# ============================================
# WHAT TO TRACK IN GIT (Recommendations)
# ============================================

# KEEP THESE:
# - Source code (modular scripts, not monoliths)
# - Configuration files
# - Schema definitions
# - User documentation (README.md, QUICKSTART.md, CHANGELOG.md)
# - Small final release files (<10 MB)
# - Final entity file (only one version)
# - Sample data for testing (not full dataset)
# - Relationship sources in CSV format (not JSON - easier to diff)
